hone de Coraline.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "Vous \u00eates bien sur la messagerie \u00e9lectronique de Coraline.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "id": 1, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "Vous \u00eates bien sur le portable de Coraline.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "text": "", "id": 2, "selected": 0}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Quelle instruction donne-t-elle ?", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "Laisser un message avant le bip sonore.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "Laisser un message sans nom ni coordonn\u00e9es.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "id": 1, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "Laisser un message apr\u00e8s le bip sonore.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "text": "", "id": 2, "selected": 0}], "id": 1}, {"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Que conseille-t-elle de faire si on doit la contacter d'urgence ?", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "On devrait laisser un message sur la bo\u00eete vocale de son num\u00e9ro de portable.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "Ce n'est pas possible de la contacter d'urgence.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "id": 1, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "On devrait lui \u00e9crire un texto.", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "text": "", "id": 2, "selected": 0}], "id": 2}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "id": 3, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Pierre a mal <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_3_0\">compris</span> les indications !", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 2", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Quelque chose ne va pas. Essayez encore une fois 